{{head|nb|verb|imperative|vis|present tense|viser|simple past|viste|past participle|vist|present participle|visende}}

# to [[show]]
# to send someone on their way
#: '''''vise''' noen til en dyktig lege''
#:: send someone to a proficient physician
#: '''''vise''' bort''
#:: turn away

